<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Membership Challenge</h1>
    <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">To gain full access to the Math Club and see who is posting, you must prove your worth by solving the following problem.</p>
    <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined') { %>
      <div class="error"><%= error %></div>
    <% } %>

    <div style="background: #f1f2f6; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">
      Up to isomorphism, how many total groups (both abelian and non-abelian) exist of order 8?
    </div>
    </div>

    <form action="/member" method="POST">
      <label for="math_answer">Your Answer:</label>
      <input type="text" id="math_answer" name="math_answer" placeholder="Enter your answer" required autocomplete="off">
      <button type="submit">Submit Answer</button>
    </form>
    
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/log">← Back to the Log</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>